<title>USA: Restrac names new president.</title>
<headline>Restrac names new president.</headline>
<dateline>LEXINGTON, Mass. 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Restrac Inc said Monday it has named Martin Fahey president of the company.</p>
<p>Fahey has served as the company's chief operating officer since 1996. He will continue to oversee daily operations of the company, Restrac said.</p>
<p>Fahey succeeds Lars Perkins, who remains chief executive.</p>
<p>The company also said it had named Bob Kuhne vice president of sales at the automated staffing solutions company.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
